    // Style: bold (since block style bold)? Original input text is bold (as discussed). Our block style bold will make content bold? Actually Paragraph style default (not bold) will override? To get bold input, set Paragraph style bold? Let's set input style bold.
    let r = Rect { x: inner.x, y: inner.y, width: inner.width, height: 1 };
